    "updated_at": "2017-08-03T07:20:27Z",
    "body": "That sounds reasonable. So a good start would be to turn that third paragraph into a list of conditions for clarity. And then add a conditional that uses https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/common-microsyntaxes.html#matches-the-environment on the value of the media attribute.",
